  designNotes: 'Die Another Day for the player, holy: Grace until the Dusk of the
    next Day, your Health can hit 0 and you don''t lose. At that Dusk, still at 0
    or less, you do. If both players fall to 0 at once, the one in Grace wins.'
  artDescription: A battered knight at 0 Health, a red health bar empty above his
